{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "> ⚠️ **Imported Mathematica notebook — read-only view.**\n> This is a live conversion of a `.nb` file and cannot be saved in place.\n> Run **Wolfbook: Save .nb copy as .wb** to get an editable, runnable copy.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# RUN: Introduction",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "\\<The gl(3) representation are labeled by the eigenvalues of the Cartans of the highest weight state:\nRep1= {λ[1,1],λ[1,2],λ[1,3]}\nRep2={λ[2,1],λ[2,2],λ[2,3]}\n\nWe have that:\nλ[*,1] >= λ[*,2] >= λ[*,3]\\>",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[w1, w2];\nw1 = 0;\nw2 = 1;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[FUNDAMENTAL, ANTIFUNDAMENTAL, ADJOINT];\n(*Rep of gl(4)*)\nFUNDAMENTAL={1,0,0,0};\nANTIFUNDAMENTAL={1,1,1,0};\nADJOINT={2,1,1,0};",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Ng=4;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# RUN: GL(4) generators",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Gl(4) generators",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ps[rep_]:=ps[rep]=Block[{res=(Prepend[rep,#]&/@(Tuples[Table[Range[rep[[1,i+1]],rep[[1,i]]],{i,1,Length[rep[[1]]]-1}]]))},If[Length[res[[1,1]]]==1,Reverse@Sort@res,Reverse@Sort@Flatten[ps/@res,1]]];\ndim[rep_]:=dim[rep]=Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_]:=J0[k][pat]=Sum[pat[[k,i]],{i,1,k}]-Sum[pat[[k-1,i]],{i,1,k-1}];\nJp[k_][pat_]:=Jp[k][pat]=-Sum[Product[pat[[k,i]]-i-pat[[k+1,j]]+j,{j,Range[k+1]}]/Product[pat[[k,i]]-i-pat[[k,j]]+j,{j,Complement[Range[k],{i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat,{k,i}->pat[[k,i]]+1]],{i,1,k}];\nJm[k_][pat_]:=Jm[k][pat]=Sum[Product[pat[[k,i]]-i-pat[[k-1,j]]+j,{j,Range[k-1]}]/Product[pat[[k,i]]-i-pat[[k,j]]+j,{j,Complement[Range[k],{i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat,{k,i}->pat[[k,i]]-1]],{i,1,k}];\nJJ[k_,l_,rep_]:=JJ[k,l,rep]=Which[k==l,DiagonalMatrix[J0[k]/@ps[{rep}]],l==k+1,Transpose[Table[Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]],v[#]]&/@ps[{rep}],{i,1,Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],l==k-1,Transpose[Table[Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]],v[#]]&/@ps[{rep}],{i,1,Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],l>k+1,JJ[k,k+1,rep].JJ[k+1,l,rep]-JJ[k+1,l,rep].JJ[k,k+1,rep],l<k-1,JJ[k,k-1,rep].JJ[k-1,l,rep]-JJ[k-1,l,rep].JJ[k,k-1,rep]];\nCC[k_,set_,rep_]:=CC[k,set,rep]=Sum[Dot[Sequence@@Table[JJ[j[i+1],j[i],rep],{i,1,k}]]/.j[k+1]->j[1],Evaluate[Sequence@@Array[{j[#],set}&,k]]];\nCCDiag[k_,set_,rep_]:=CCDiag[k,set,rep]=Diagonal[Inverse[Transpose[Eigenvectors[CC[Length[set],set,rep]]]].CC[k,set,rep].Transpose[Eigenvectors[CC[Length[set],set,rep]]]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Hermitian generators",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[JJH,PM,SolvePH,PH,PElement];\nPM[rep_]:=PM[rep]=DiagonalMatrix[Table[PElement[i],{i,1,dim[rep]}]];\nSolvePH[rep_]:=SolvePH[rep]=FullSimplify[(Solve[(DeleteDuplicates[Table[PM[rep].JJ[k,l,rep].Inverse[PM[rep]]-Inverse[PM[rep]].ConjugateTranspose[JJ[l,k,rep]].PM[rep],{k,1,Ng},{l,1,Ng}]//Flatten])==0,Table[PElement[i],{i,1,dim[rep]}]])];(*If PM is real*)\nPH[rep_,Optional[M_,1]]:=PH[rep,Optional[M,1]]=(PM[rep]/.SolvePH[rep])[[M]]//Simplify;\n(*If PM is complex*)(*Solve[(DeleteDuplicates[Table[PM[rep].JJ[k,l,rep].Inverse[PM[rep]]-ConjugateTranspose[PM[rep].JJ[l,k,rep].Inverse[PM[rep]]],{k,1,3},{l,1,3}]//Flatten])==0,Table[PElement[i],{i,1,dim[rep]}]];*)\nJJH[k_,l_,rep_,Optional[M_,1]]:=JJH[k,l,rep,Optional[M,1]]=(PH[rep,M].JJ[k,l,rep].Inverse[PH[rep,M]])//Simplify;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Definition matrices for Lax connection",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[e,EM,Id];\ne[a_,b_,rep1_]:=e[a,b,rep1]=SparseArray[{a,b}->1,{dim[rep1],dim[rep1]}];\nEM[a_,b_,rep1_]:=EM[a,b,rep1]=JJ[a,b,rep1];(*Non Hermitian generators*)\n(*JJH[a,b,rep1];*)\nId[rep1_]:=Id[rep1]=SparseArray[{a_,a_}->1,{dim[rep1],dim[rep1]}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Generator of overall rotation $(e^{\\mathrm{All}}$)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[EMAll];\nEMAll[a_,b_,rep1_,rep2_]:=EMAll[a,b,rep1,rep2]=KroneckerProduct[EM[a,b,rep1],Id[rep2]]+KroneckerProduct[Id[rep1],EM[a,b,rep2]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Module to find good weights for the rep",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[FindWeight,FindGoodWeight];\nFindWeight[rep_]:=Table[{EM[1,1,rep][[n,n]],EM[2,2,rep][[n,n]],EM[3,3,rep][[n,n]],EM[4,4,rep][[n,n]]},{n,1,dim[rep]}];\nFindGoodWeight[rep_]:=Pick[FindWeight[rep],Lookup[Counts[FindWeight[rep]],FindWeight[rep]],1]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[FindWeight2All,FindWeight2,FindGoodWeight2]\nFindWeight2All[rep1_,rep2_]:=FindWeight2All[rep1,rep2]=Flatten[Table[{EM[1,1,rep1][[n,n]]+EM[1,1,rep2][[m,m]],\nEM[2,2,rep1][[n,n]]+EM[2,2,rep2][[m,m]],\nEM[3,3,rep1][[n,n]]+EM[3,3,rep2][[m,m]],EM[4,4,rep1][[n,n]]+EM[4,4,rep2][[m,m]]},{n,1,dim[rep1]},{m,1,dim[rep2]}],1];\nFindWeight2[rep1_,rep2_]:=FindWeight2[rep1,rep2]=DeleteDuplicates[FindWeight2All[rep1,rep2]];\nFindGoodWeight2[rep1_,rep2_]:=FindGoodWeight2[rep1,rep2]=Pick[FindWeight2All[rep1,rep2],Lookup[Counts[FindWeight2All[rep1,rep2]],FindWeight2All[rep1,rep2]],1]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "From Dynkin (Δ,l) label of sl(2) to weights of gl(3)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[WeightDynkin,λ1,λ2,λ3];\nWeightDynkin[Δ_,l_]:=Solve[λ1-λ2==(Δ)&&λ2-λ3==l&&λ1+λ2+λ3==0,{λ1,λ2,λ3}]\n(*Fundamental*)\nWeightDynkin[1,0]\n(*AntiFundamental*)\nWeightDynkin[0,1]\n(*Adjoint*)\nWeightDynkin[1,1]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-out-n=\"37\" data-sub-idx=\"0\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[37]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"0\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRce1xsZWZ0XHtcbGFtYmRhMVx0byBcZnJhY3syfXszfSxcbGFtYmRhMlx0byAtXGZyYWN7MX17M30sXGxhbWJkYTNcdG8gLVxmcmFjezF9ezN9XHJpZ2h0XH1ccmlnaHRcfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">{</span></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">}</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
