   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## ADJOINT BAXTER",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Adjoint Baxter equation with $F^{\\dag }$",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "\\<HERE we consider only the case C1=1,C2=1 in the definition of M\\>",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Shifted Hamiltonians (already with $F^{\\dag }$)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[ϵ1S†,ϵ2S†,ϵ3S†];\nϵ1S†[rep1_,rep2_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z_]:=ϵ1S†[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=-ϵ1S[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z]+4*(D[μ[rep1,rep2][z],z])/(μ[rep1,rep2][z]);\nϵ2S†[rep1_,rep2_,repAll_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z_]:=ϵ2S†[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=ϵ2S[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z]-3*D[ϵ1S[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z],z]-3*ϵ1S[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z]*(D[μ[rep1,rep2][z],z])/(μ[rep1,rep2][z])+6*(D[μ[rep1,rep2][z],{z,2}])/(μ[rep1,rep2][z]);\nϵ3S†[rep1_,rep2_,repAll_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z_]:=ϵ3S†[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=-ϵ3S[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z]+2*D[ϵ2S[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z],z]-3*D[ϵ1S[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z],{z,2}]+(D[μ[rep1,rep2][z],z])/(μ[rep1,rep2][z])*(2*ϵ2S[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z]-6*D[ϵ1S[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z],z])-3*(D[μ[rep1,rep2][z],{z,2}])/(μ[rep1,rep2][z])*ϵ1S[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z]+4*(D[μ[rep1,rep2][z],{z,3}])/(μ[rep1,rep2][z]);\nϵ4S†[rep1_,rep2_,repAll_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z_]:=ϵ4S†[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=ϵ4S[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z]-D[ϵ3S[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z],z]+D[ϵ2S[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z],{z,2}]-D[ϵ1S[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z],{z,3}]+(D[μ[rep1,rep2][z],z])/(μ[rep1,rep2][z])*(-ϵ3S[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z]+2*D[ϵ2S[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z],z]-3*D[ϵ1S[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z],{z,2}])+(D[μ[rep1,rep2][z],{z,2}])/(μ[rep1,rep2][z])*(ϵ2S[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z]-3D[ϵ1S[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z],z])-ϵ1S[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1,1][z]*(D[μ[rep1,rep2][z],{z,3}])/(μ[rep1,rep2][z])+(D[μ[rep1,rep2][z],{z,4}])/(μ[rep1,rep2][z]);",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[BaxOp†];\nBaxOp†[rep1_,rep2_,repAll_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_]:=D[#,{z,4}]+ϵ1S†[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]*D[#,{z,3}]+ϵ2S†[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]*D[#,{z,2}]+ϵ3S†[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]*D[#,z]+ϵ4S†[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]*#&;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Q functions",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[QPoly†,Q†,c1†,c2†,c3†,c4†];\nQPoly†[c_,M_,r_][z_]:=QPoly†[c,M,r][z]=Exp[r z]*(z^M+Sum[c[k]*z^k,{k,0,M-1}]);\nQ†[1][rep1_,rep2_,repAll_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z]:=Q†[1][rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=QPoly†[c1†,-rep1〚4〛-rep2〚4〛+repAll〚1〛,ϕ1][z];\nQ†[2][rep1_,rep2_,repAll_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z]:=Q†[2][rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=QPoly†[c2†,-rep1〚4〛-rep2〚4〛+repAll〚2〛,ϕ2][z];\nQ†[3][rep1_,rep2_,repAll_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z]:=Q†[3][rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=QPoly†[c3†,-rep1〚4〛-rep2〚4〛+repAll〚3〛,ϕ3][z];\nQ†[4][rep1_,rep2_,repAll_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z]:=Q†[4][rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=QPoly†[c4†,-rep1〚4〛-rep2〚4〛+repAll〚4〛,ϕ4][z];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Baxter equations",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[Bax†];\nBax†[1][rep1_,rep2_,repAll_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_]:=Bax†[1][rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4]=((BaxOp†[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][Q†[1][rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]])*Exp[-ϕ1 z])//Simplify;\nBax†[2][rep1_,rep2_,repAll_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_]:=Bax†[2][rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4]=((BaxOp†[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][Q†[2][rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]])*Exp[-ϕ2 z])//Simplify;\nBax†[3][rep1_,rep2_,repAll_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_]:=Bax†[3][rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4]=((BaxOp†[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][Q†[3][rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]])*Exp[-ϕ3 z])//Simplify;\nBax†[4][rep1_,rep2_,repAll_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_]:=Bax†[4][rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4]=((BaxOp†[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][Q†[4][rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]])*Exp[-ϕ4 z])//Simplify;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Unknown coefficients",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[Vars1†,Vars2†,Vars3†,Vars4†];\nVars1†[rep1_,rep2_,repAll_]:=Vars1†[rep1,rep2,repAll]=Table[c1†[n],{n,0,-rep1〚4〛-rep2〚4〛+repAll〚1〛-1}];\nVars2†[rep1_,rep2_,repAll_]:=Vars2†[rep1,rep2,repAll]=Table[c2†[n],{n,0,-rep1〚4〛-rep2〚4〛+repAll〚2〛-1}];\nVars3†[rep1_,rep2_,repAll_]:=Vars3†[rep1,rep2,repAll]=Table[c3†[n],{n,0,-rep1〚4〛-rep2〚4〛+repAll〚3〛-1}];\nVars4†[rep1_,rep2_,repAll_]:=Vars4†[rep1,rep2,repAll]=Table[c4†[n],{n,0,-rep1〚4〛-rep2〚4〛+repAll〚4〛-1}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Solving Baxter equations giving hs",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
