  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "#### Def H4",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[H4U];\nH4U[rep1_,rep2_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z_]:=H4U[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=trAL4[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]+(3)/(4)*trALLLp[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]+(1)/(2)*trALLpL[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]+(1)/(4)*trALpLL[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]+\n(1)/(2)*trALLpp[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]+(1)/(2)*trALpLp[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]+(1)/(6)*trALppL[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]+\n(1)/(4)*Sum[D[LIndex[a,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],{z,3}],{a,1,Ng}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### H4 Simplified",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[H4];\nH4[rep1_,rep2_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z_]:=H4[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=H4U[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Definition Residue of H",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Clear[ResH4];\nResH4[rep1_,rep2_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_,w_]:=ResH4[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,w]=SeriesCoefficient[H4[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]//Normal,{z,w,-1}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Clear[ResH4O];\nResH4O[rep1_,rep2_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_,w_,o_]:=ResH4O[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,w,o]=SeriesCoefficient[H4[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]//Normal,{z,w,o}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Example of use",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "H4[FUNDAMENTAL,FUNDAMENTAL,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]//Normal//Simplify;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Check eigenvalues",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "UPR[rep1_,rep2_]:=UPR[rep1,rep2]=Table[{KroneckerDelta[j,1]},{j,1,dim[rep1]*dim[rep2]}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "rep1=FUNDAMENTAL;\nrep2=ADJOINT;",
