   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Adjoint Hamiltonians TO DO",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## H1†",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Regulated Hamiltonian $\\operatorname{tr}\\left(L\\right)$",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[H1†];\nH1†[rep1_,rep2_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_][z_]:=H1†[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z]=H1[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z](*Sum[LIndex[a,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{a,1,3}]//Simplify;*)",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Definition Residue of H",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Clear[ResH1†];\nResH1†[rep1_,rep2_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,w_]:=ResH1†[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,w]=SeriesCoefficient[H1†[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z]//Normal,{z,w,-1}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "#### Example of use",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[rep1,rep2];\nrep1=FUNDAMENTAL;\nrep2=FUNDAMENTAL;\nH1†[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z]//Normal;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## H2†",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Regulated Hamiltonian -$\\operatorname{tr}\\left(L'\\right)+\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\operatorname{tr}\\left(L\\right)\\right)^2-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{tr}\\left(L^2\\right)$",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[H2†];\nH2†[rep1_,rep2_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_][z_]:=H2†[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z]=(-Sum[D[LIndex[a,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],z],{a,1,3}]+(1)/(2)*(Sum[LIndex[a,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{a,1,3}]).(Sum[LIndex[a,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{a,1,3}])-(1)/(2)*Sum[LIndex[a,b,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z].LIndex[b,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{a,1,3},{b,1,3}])//Simplify",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Definition Residue of H",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Clear[ResH2†];\nResH2†[rep1_,rep2_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,w_]:=ResH2†[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,w]=SeriesCoefficient[H2†[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z]//Normal,{z,w,-1}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## H3†",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### H3† simplified $\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{tr}\\left(L''\\right)+\\operatorname{tr}\\left(L'.\\,L\\right)-\\frac{2}{3}\\operatorname{tr}\\left(L'\\right).\\,\\operatorname{tr}\\left(L\\right)-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{tr}\\left(L\\right).\\,\\operatorname{tr}\\left(L^2\\right)+\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{tr}\\left(L\\right)^3+\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{tr}\\left(L^3\\right)$",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[H3†];\nH3†[rep1_,rep2_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_][z_]:=H3†[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z]=((1)/(3)*Sum[D[LIndex[a,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{z,2}],{a,1,3}]+Sum[D[LIndex[a,b,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],z].LIndex[b,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{a,1,3},{b,1,3}]-(2)/(3)*Sum[D[LIndex[a,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],z],{a,1,3}].Sum[LIndex[a,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{a,1,3}]-(1)/(2)*Sum[LIndex[a,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{a,1,3}].Sum[LIndex[a,b,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z].LIndex[b,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{a,1,3},{b,1,3}]+(1)/(6)*(Sum[LIndex[a,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{a,1,3}]).(Sum[LIndex[a,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{a,1,3}]).(Sum[LIndex[a,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{a,1,3}])+(1)/(3)*Sum[LIndex[a,b,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z].LIndex[b,c,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z].LIndex[c,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{a,1,3},{b,1,3},{c,1,3}])//Simplify;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Definition Residue of H",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Clear[ResH3†];\nResH3†[rep1_,rep2_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,w_]:=ResH3†[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,w]=SeriesCoefficient[H3[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z]//Normal,{z,w,-1}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Example of use",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Series[H3†[ADJOINT,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z]//Normal,{z,0,-3}]//Simplify//Normal;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Eigenvectors (FIRST RUN Q SPACE)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Right eigenvectors (column)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[VecR,VecR1];\nVecR[rep1_,rep2_]:=VecR[rep1,rep2]=Table[{v[j]},{j,1,dim[rep1]*dim[rep2]}];\nVecR1[rep1_]:=VecR1[rep1]=Table[{v[j]},{j,1,dim[rep1]}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[EigenR];\nEigenR[rep1_,rep2_,repAll_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_]:=EigenR[rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4]=Table[Quiet[Flatten[VecR[rep1,rep2]/.Solve[\nCoefficientList[((H2[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].VecR[rep1,rep2]-HSpectrum[2][rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z][[idx]]* VecR[rep1,rep2]))//Together//Numerator,z]==0&&\nCoefficientList[((H3[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].VecR[rep1,rep2]-HSpectrum[3][rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z][[idx]]* VecR[rep1,rep2]))//Together//Numerator,z]==0&&\nCoefficientList[((H4[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].VecR[rep1,rep2]-HSpectrum[4][rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z][[idx]]* VecR[rep1,rep2]))//Together//Numerator,z]==0,Flatten[VecR[rep1,rep2]]],1]],{idx,1,Dimensions[HSpectrum[1][rep1,rep2,repAll,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]][[1]]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "#### Example",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "EigenR[FUNDAMENTAL,FUNDAMENTAL,{1,1,0,0},3,5,7,9]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-out-n=\"338\" data-sub-idx=\"0\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[338]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"0\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">{</span></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">{</span></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span 