  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Mean value",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Measure",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 1-site",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Measure such that <f $\\mathcal{O}_Fg>\\,\\overset{\\lnot }{=}$ <g ${\\mathcal{O}_F}^{\\dag }\\,f>$",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[μ1,μ2];\nμ1[rep1_][z_]:=μ1[rep1][z]=z^(-rep1[[1]]+rep1[[4]]);\nμ2[rep2_][z_]:=μ2[rep2][z]=(-1+z)^(-rep2[[1]]+rep2[[4]]);",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Mean value",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[MeanValue1,MeanValue2];\nMeanValue1[f_,τ_,rep1_]:=MeanValue1[f,τ,rep1]=\n2 π I Residue[(f*μ1[rep1][z]),{z,τ}];\nMeanValue2[f_,τ_,rep2_]:=MeanValue2[f,τ,rep2]=\n2 π I Residue[(f*μ2[rep2][z]),{z,τ}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## ADJOINT BAXTER",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Adjoint Baxter equation with $F^{\\dag }$",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "\\<HERE we consider only the case C1=1,C2=1 in the definition of M\\>",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Shifted Hamiltonians (already with $F^{\\dag }$)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[ϵ11S†,ϵ12S†,ϵ13S†];\nϵ11S†[rep1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z_]:=ϵ11S†[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=-ϵ11S[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1][z]+4*(D[μ1[rep1][z],z])/(μ1[rep1][z]);\nϵ12S†[rep1_,weight1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z_]:=ϵ12S†[rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=ϵ12S[rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1][z]-3*D[ϵ11S[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1][z],z]-3*ϵ11S[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1][z]*(D[μ1[rep1][z],z])/(μ1[rep1][z])+6*(D[μ1[rep1][z],{z,2}])/(μ1[rep1][z]);\nϵ13S†[rep1_,weight1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z_]:=ϵ13S†[rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=-ϵ13S[rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1][z]+2*D[ϵ12S[rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1][z],z]-3*D[ϵ11S[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1][z],{z,2}]+(D[μ1[rep1][z],z])/(μ1[rep1][z])*(2*ϵ12S[rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1][z]-6*D[ϵ11S[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1][z],z])-3*(D[μ1[rep1][z],{z,2}])/(μ1[rep1][z])*ϵ11S[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1][z]+4*(D[μ1[rep1][z],{z,3}])/(μ1[rep1][z]);\nϵ14S†[rep1_,weight1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z_]:=ϵ14S†[rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=ϵ14S[rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1][z]-D[ϵ13S[rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1][z],z]+D[ϵ12S[rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1][z],{z,2}]-D[ϵ11S[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1][z],{z,3}]+(D[μ1[rep1][z],z])/(μ1[rep1][z])*(-ϵ13S[rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1][z]+2*D[ϵ12S[rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1][z],z]-3*D[ϵ11S[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1][z],{z,2}])+(D[μ1[rep1][z],{z,2}])/(μ1[rep1][z])*(ϵ12S[rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1][z]-3D[ϵ11S[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1][z],z])-ϵ11S[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1][z]*(D[μ1[rep1][z],{z,3}])/(μ1[rep1][z])+(D[μ1[rep1][z],{z,4}])/(μ1[rep1][z]);",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[BaxOp1†];\nBaxOp1†[rep1_,weight1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_]:=D[#,{z,4}]+ϵ11S†[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]*D[#,{z,3}]+ϵ12S†[rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]*D[#,{z,2}]+ϵ13S†[rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]*D[#,z]+ϵ14S†[rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]*#&;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Q functions",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[QPoly†,Q1†,c11†,c12†,c13†,c14†];\nQPoly†[c_,M_,r_][z_]:=QPoly†[c,M,r][z]=Exp[r z]*(z^M+Sum[c[k]*z^k,{k,0,M-1}]);\nQ1†[1][rep1_,weight1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z]:=Q1†[1][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=QPoly†[c11†,-rep1〚4〛+weight1〚1〛,ϕ1][z];\nQ1†[2][rep1_,weight1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z]:=Q1†[2][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=QPoly†[c12†,-rep1〚4〛+weight1〚2〛,ϕ2][z];\nQ1†[3][rep1_,weight1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z]:=Q1†[3][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=QPoly†[c13†,-rep1〚4〛+weight1〚3〛,ϕ3][z];\nQ1†[4][rep1_,weight1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z]:=Q1†[4][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=QPoly†[c14†,-rep1〚4〛+weight1〚4〛,ϕ4][z];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Baxter equations",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[Bax1†];\nBax1†[1][rep1_,weight1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_]:=Bax1†[1][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4]=((BaxOp1†[rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][Q1†[1][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]])*Exp[-ϕ1 z])//Simplify;\nBax1†[2][rep1_,weight1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_]:=Bax1†[2][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4]=((BaxOp1†[rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][Q1†[2][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]])*Exp[-ϕ2 z])//Simplify;\nBax1†[3][rep1_,weight1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_]:=Bax1†[3][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4]=((BaxOp1†[rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][Q1†[3][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]])*Exp[-ϕ3 z])//Simplify;\nBax1†[4][rep1_,weight1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_]:=Bax1†[4][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4]=((BaxOp1†[rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][Q1†[4][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]])*Exp[-ϕ4 z])//Simplify;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Unknown coefficients",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[Vars11†,Vars12†,Vars13†,Vars14†];\nVars11†[rep1_,weight1_]:=Vars11†[rep1,weight1]=Table[c11†[n],{n,0,-rep1〚4〛+weight1〚1〛-1}];\nVars12†[rep1_,weight1_]:=Vars12†[rep1,weight1]=Table[c12†[n],{n,0,-rep1〚4〛+weight1〚2〛-1}];\nVars13†[rep1_,weight1_]:=Vars13†[rep1,weight1]=Table[c13†[n],{n,0,-rep1〚4〛+weight1〚3〛-1}];\nVars14†[rep1_,weight1_]:=Vars14†[rep1,weight1]=Table[c14†[n],{n,0,-rep1〚4〛+weight1〚4〛-1}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Solving Baxter equations giving hs",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[SolveBaxh1†,SolveBaxAllh1†];\nSolveBaxh1†[1][rep1_,weight1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_,h33_,h43_,h45_]:=SolveBaxh1†[1][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,h33,h43,h45]=Solve[CoefficientList[Bax1†[1][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4]/.{h1[3,3]->h33,\nh1[4,3]->h43,h1[4,5]->h45}//Together//Numerator,z]==0,Vars11†[rep1,weight1]]//Simplify//Flatten;\n\nSolveBaxh1†[2][rep1_,weight1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_,h33_,h43_,h45_]:=SolveBaxh1†[2][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,h33,h43,h45]=Solve[CoefficientList[Bax1†[2][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4]/.{h1[3,3]->h33,\nh1[4,3]->h43,h1[4,5]->h45}//Together//Numerator,z]==0,Vars12†[rep1,weight1]]//Simplify//Flatten;\n\nSolveBaxh1†[3][rep1_,weight1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_,h33_,h43_,h45_]:=SolveBaxh1†[3][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,h33,h43,h45]=Solve[CoefficientList[Bax1†[3][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4]/.{h1[3,3]->h33,\nh1[4,3]->h43,h1[4,5]->h45}//Together//Numerator,z]==0,Vars13†[rep1,weight1]]//Simplify//Flatten;\n\nSolveBaxh1†[4][rep1_,weight1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_,h33_,h43_,h45_]:=SolveBaxh1†[4][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,h33,h43,h45]=Solve[CoefficientList[Bax1†[4][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4]/.{h1[3,3]->h33,\nh1[4,3]->h43,h1[4,5]->h45}//Together//Numerator,z]==0,Vars14†[rep1,weight1]]//Simplify//Flatten;\n\nSolveBaxAllh1†[rep1_,weight1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_,h33_,h43_,h45_]:=SolveBaxAllh1†[rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,h33,h43,h45]=Join[SolveBaxh1†[1][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,h33,h43,h45],SolveBaxh1†[2][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,h33,h43,h45],SolveBaxh1†[3][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,h33,h43,h45],SolveBaxh1†[4][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,h33,h43,h45]]//Simplify;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "#### Example of use",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Solh1=(SolveBaxAll1[FUNDAMENTAL,FUNDAMENTAL,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,1]//Simplify)[[1]]\n\nSolveBaxh1†[1][FUNDAMENTAL,FUNDAMENTAL,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,h1[3,3]/.Solh1,h1[4,3]/.Solh1,h1[4,5]/.Solh1]\nSolveBaxh1†[2][FUNDAMENTAL,FUNDAMENTAL,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,h1[3,3]/.Solh1,h1[4,3]/.Solh1,h1[4,5]/.Solh1]\nSolveBaxh1†[3][FUNDAMENTAL,FUNDAMENTAL,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,h1[3,3]/.Solh1,h1[4,3]/.Solh1,h1[4,5]/.Solh1]\nSolveBaxh1†[4][FUNDAMENTAL,FUNDAMENTAL,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,h1[3,3]/.Solh1,h1[4,3]/.Solh1,h1[4,5]/.Solh1]\n\nPrint[\"\\<Hi\\>\"]\nSolveBaxAllh1†[FUNDAMENTAL,FUNDAMENTAL,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,h1[3,3]/.Solh1,h1[4,3]/.Solh1,h1[4,5]/.Solh1]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-out-n=\"488\" data-sub-idx=\"0\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[488]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"0\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" styl