   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(*L^3*)\nClearAll[trA1LLLp,trA1LLpL,trA1LpLL];\ntrA1LLLp[rep1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z_]:=trA1LLLp[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=(1)/(6)*Sum[LIndex1[i1,i1,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].LIndex1[i2,i2,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].D[LIndex1[i3,i3,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],z]-LIndex1[i1,i1,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].LIndex1[i3,i2,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].D[LIndex1[i2,i3,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],z]-LIndex1[i2,i1,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].LIndex1[i1,i2,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].D[LIndex1[i3,i3,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],z]+LIndex1[i2,i1,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].LIndex1[i3,i2,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].D[LIndex1[i1,i3,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],z]+LIndex1[i3,i1,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].LIndex1[i1,i2,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].D[LIndex1[i2,i3,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],z]-LIndex1[i3,i1,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].LIndex1[i2,i2,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].D[LIndex1[i1,i3,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],z],{i1,1,Ng},{i2,1,Ng},{i3,1,Ng}];\n\ntrA1LLpL[rep1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z_]:=trA1LLpL[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=(1)/(6)*Sum[LIndex1[i1,i1,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].D[LIndex1[i2,i2,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],z].LIndex1[i3,i3,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]-LIndex1[i1,i1,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].D[LIndex1[i3,i2,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],z].LIndex1[i2,i3,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]-LIndex1[i2,i1,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].D[LIndex1[i1,i2,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],z].LIndex1[i3,i3,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]+LIndex1[i2,i1,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].D[LIndex1[i3,i2,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],z].LIndex1[i1,i3,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]+LIndex1[i3,i1,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].D[LIndex1[i1,i2,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],z].LIndex1[i2,i3,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]-LIndex1[i3,i1,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].D[LIndex1[i2,i2,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],z].LIndex1[i1,i3,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],{i1,1,Ng},{i2,1,Ng},{i3,1,Ng}];\n\ntrA1LpLL[rep1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z_]:=trA1LpLL[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=(1)/(6)*Sum[D[LIndex1[i1,i1,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],z].LIndex1[i2,i2,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].LIndex1[i3,i3,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]-D[LIndex1[i1,i1,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],z].LIndex1[i3,i2,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].LIndex1[i2,i3,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]-D[LIndex1[i2,i1,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],z].LIndex1[i1,i2,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].LIndex1[i3,i3,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]+D[LIndex1[i2,i1,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],z].LIndex1[i3,i2,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].LIndex1[i1,i3,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]+D[LIndex1[i3,i1,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],z].LIndex1[i1,i2,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].LIndex1[i2,i3,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]-D[LIndex1[i3,i1,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],z].LIndex1[i2,i2,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].LIndex1[i1,i3,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],{i1,1,Ng},{i2,1,Ng},{i3,1,Ng}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(*L^2*)\nClearAll[trA1LLpp,trA1LpLp,trA1LppL];\ntrA1LLpp[rep1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z_]:=trA1LLpp[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=(1)/(2)*(Sum[LIndex1[a,a,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].D[LIndex1[b,b,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],{z,2}]-LIndex1[b,a,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].D[LIndex1[a,b,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],{z,2}],{a,1,Ng},{b,1,Ng}]);\n\ntrA1LpLp[rep1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z_]:=trA1LpLp[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=(1)/(2)*(Sum[D[LIndex1[a,a,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],z].D[LIndex1[b,b,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],z]-D[LIndex1[b,a,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],z].D[LIndex1[a,b,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],z],{a,1,Ng},{b,1,Ng}]);\n\ntrA1LppL[rep1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z_]:=trA1LppL[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=(1)/(2)*(Sum[D[LIndex1[a,a,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],{z,2}].LIndex1[b,b,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]-D[LIndex1[b,a,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],{z,2}].LIndex1[a,b,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],{a,1,Ng},{b,1,Ng}]);",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "#### Def H4",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[H14U];\nH14U[rep1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z_]:=H14U[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=trA1L4[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]+(3)/(4)*trA1LLLp[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]+(1)/(2)*trA1LLpL[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]+(1)/(4)*trA1LpLL[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]+\n(1)/(2)*trA1LLpp[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]+(1)/(2)*trA1LpLp[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]+(1)/(6)*trA1LppL[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]+\n(1)/(4)*Sum[D[LIndex1[a,a,rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z],{z,3}],{a,1,Ng}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### H4 Simplified",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[H14];\nH14[rep1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_][z_]:=H14[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]=H14U[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Definition Residue of H",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Clear[ResH14];\nResH14[rep1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_,w_]:=ResH14[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,w]=SeriesCoefficient[H14[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]//Normal,{z,w,-1}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Clear[ResH14O];\nResH14O[rep1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_,w_,o_]:=ResH14O[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4,w,o]=SeriesCoefficient[H14[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]//Normal,{z,w,o}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Example of use",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "H14[FUNDAMENTAL,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]//Normal//Simplify;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Adjoint Hamiltonians TO DO",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## H1†",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Regulated Hamiltonian $\\operatorname{tr}\\left(L\\right)$",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[H1†];\nH1†[rep1_,rep2_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_][z_]:=H1†[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z]=H1[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z](*Sum[LIndex[a,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{a,1,3}]//Simplify;*)",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Definition Residue of H",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Clear[ResH1†];\nResH1†[rep1_,rep2_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,w_]:=ResH1†[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,w]=SeriesCoefficient[H1†[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z]//Normal,{z,w,-1}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "#### Example of use",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[rep1,rep2];\nrep1=FUNDAMENTAL;\nrep2=FUNDAMENTAL;\nH1†[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z]//Normal;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## H2†",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Regulated Hamiltonian -$\\operatorname{tr}\\left(L'\\right)+\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\operatorname{tr}\\left(L\\right)\\right)^2-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{tr}\\left(L^2\\right)$",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[H2†];\nH2†[rep1_,rep2_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_][z_]:=H2†[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z]=(-Sum[D[LIndex[a,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],z],{a,1,3}]+(1)/(2)*(Sum[LIndex[a,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{a,1,3}]).(Sum[LIndex[a,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{a,1,3}])-(1)/(2)*Sum[LIndex[a,b,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z].LIndex[b,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{a,1,3},{b,1,3}])//Simplify",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Definition Residue of H",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Clear[ResH2†];\nResH2†[rep1_,rep2_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,w_]:=ResH2†[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,w]=SeriesCoefficient[H2†[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z]//Normal,{z,w,-1}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## H3†",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### H3† simplified $\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{tr}\\left(L''\\right)+\\operatorname{tr}\\left(L'.\\,L\\right)-\\frac{2}{3}\\operatorname{tr}\\left(L'\\right).\\,\\operatorname{tr}\\left(L\\right)-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{tr}\\left(L\\right).\\,\\operatorname{tr}\\left(L^2\\right)+\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{tr}\\left(L\\right)^3+\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{tr}\\left(L^3\\right)$",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[H3†];\nH3†[rep1_,rep2_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_][z_]:=H3†[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z]=((1)/(3)*Sum[D[LIndex[a,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{z,2}],{a,1,3}]+Sum[D[LIndex[a,b,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],z].LIndex[b,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{a,1,3},{b,1,3}]-(2)/(3)*Sum[D[LIndex[a,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],z],{a,1,3}].Sum[LIndex[a,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{a,1,3}]-(1)/(2)*Sum[LIndex[a,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{a,1,3}].Sum[LIndex[a,b,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z].LIndex[b,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{a,1,3},{b,1,3}]+(1)/(6)*(Sum[LIndex[a,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{a,1,3}]).(Sum[LIndex[a,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{a,1,3}]).(Sum[LIndex[a,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{a,1,3}])+(1)/(3)*Sum[LIndex[a,b,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z].LIndex[b,c,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z].LIndex[c,a,rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z],{a,1,3},{b,1,3},{c,1,3}])//Simplify;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Definition Residue of H",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Clear[ResH3†];\nResH3†[rep1_,rep2_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,w_]:=ResH3†[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,w]=SeriesCoefficient[H3[rep1,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z]//Normal,{z,w,-1}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Example of use",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Series[H3†[ADJOINT,rep2,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3][z]//Normal,{z,0,-3}]//Simplify//Normal;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Eigenvectors (FIRST RUN Q SPACE)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Right eigenvectors (column)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[VecR1];\nVecR1[rep1_]:=VecR1[rep1]=Table[{v[j]},{j,1,dim[rep1]}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[EigenR1];\nEigenR1[rep1_,weight1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_]:=EigenR1[rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4]=Table[Quiet[Flatten[VecR1[rep1]/.Solve[\nCoefficientList[((H12[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].VecR1[rep1]-HSpectrum1[2][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z][[idx]]* VecR1[rep1]))//Together//Numerator,z]==0&&\nCoefficientList[((H13[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].VecR1[rep1]-HSpectrum1[3][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z][[idx]]* VecR1[rep1]))//Together//Numerator,z]==0&&\nCoefficientList[((H14[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z].VecR1[rep1]-HSpectrum1[4][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z][[idx]]* VecR1[rep1]))//Together//Numerator,z]==0,Flatten[VecR1[rep1]]],1]],{idx,1,Dimensions[HSpectrum1[1][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]][[1]]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "#### Example",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "EigenR1[FUNDAMENTAL,FUNDAMENTAL,3,5,7,9]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
