  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Left eigenvectors (row)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[VecL1];\nVecL1[rep1_]:=VecL1[rep1]=Transpose[VecR1[rep1]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[EigenL1];\nEigenL1[rep1_,weight1_,ϕ1_,ϕ2_,ϕ3_,ϕ4_]:=EigenL1[rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4]=Table[Quiet[Flatten[VecL1[rep1]/.Solve[\nCoefficientList[((VecL1[rep1].H12[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]-HSpectrum1[2][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z][[idx]]* VecL1[rep1]))//Together//Numerator,z]==0&&\nCoefficientList[((VecL1[rep1].H13[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]-HSpectrum1[3][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z][[idx]]* VecL1[rep1]))//Together//Numerator,z]==0&&\nCoefficientList[((VecL1[rep1].H14[rep1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]-HSpectrum1[4][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z][[idx]]* VecL1[rep1]))//Together//Numerator,z]==0,Flatten[VecL1[rep1]]],1]],{idx,1,Dimensions[HSpectrum1[1][rep1,weight1,ϕ1,ϕ2,ϕ3,ϕ4][z]][[1]]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "#### Example",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "EigenL1[FUNDAMENTAL,FUNDAMENTAL,3,5,7,9]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
