  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Normalisation",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Highest weight state",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "h.w.s. 1-site",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[UPR1,UPL1];\nUPR1[rep1_]:=UPR1[rep1]=Table[{KroneckerDelta[j,1]},{j,1,dim[rep1]}];\nUPL1[rep1_]:=UPL1[rep1]=Transpose[UPR1[rep1]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Vacuum vector",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Vacuum vector 1-site",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[VacR1,VacL1];\nVacR1[rep1_,β12_,β13_,β14_,β23_,β24_,β34_]:=VacR1[rep1,β23,β12,β13,β14,β23,β24,β34]=\nMatrixExp[β24(EM[4,2,rep1])].MatrixExp[β23(EM[3,2,rep1])].MatrixExp[β14(EM[4,1,rep1])].MatrixExp[β13(EM[3,1,rep1])].MatrixExp[β34(EM[4,3,rep1])].MatrixExp[β12(EM[2,1,rep1])].UPR1[rep1];\nVacL1[rep1_,α12_,α13_,α14_,α23_,α24_,α34_]:=VacL1[rep1,α12,α13,α14,α23,α24,α34]=UPL1[rep1].MatrixExp[α12(EM[1,2,rep1])].MatrixExp[α34(EM[3,4,rep1])].MatrixExp[α13(EM[1,3,rep1])].MatrixExp[α14(EM[1,4,rep1])].MatrixExp[α23(EM[2,3,rep1])].MatrixExp[α24(EM[2,4,rep1])];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Renormalisation",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[ReNormR1,ReNormL1,α23,α13,α12,α24,α14,α34,β23,β13,β12,β24,β14,β34];\nReNormR1[rep1_,α12_,α13_,α14_,α23_,α24_,α34_,ψ_]:=ReNormR1[rep1,α12,α13,α14,α23,α24,α34,ψ]=(ψ*(1/(((VacL1[rep1,α12,α13,α14,α23,α24,α34].ψ)//Flatten)[[1]])))//Simplify;\nReNormL1[rep1_,β12_,β13_,β14_,β23_,β24_,β34_,ψ_]:=ReNormL1[rep1,β12,β13,β14,β23,β24,β34,ψ]=(ψ*(1/((ψ.VacR1[rep1,β12,β13,β14,β23,β24,β34]//Flatten)[[1]])))//Simplify;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
